    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>Read the denial letter for the exact reason and the policy provision cited. Your response should target that reason.</li>
<li>Common Gulf Coast denial reasons include wear and tear, flood exclusion, late notice, pre-existing damage, and mold limits.</li>
